your budget. Our goal is to provide a cooling experience that is both efficient and long-lasting for every household and factory in Rajkot.\n            </p>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- PRICING TABLE: ALL SPARE PARTS & RATES -->\n        <section>\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 mb-10 justify-center\">\n                <div class=\"bg-orange-500 p-3 rounded-full shadow-lg\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-8 h-8 text-white\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\n                </div>\n                <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-blue-900 uppercase\">Rates for air cooler repair services rajkot</h2>\n            </div>\n            \n            <p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-10 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest font-bold\">Best pricing for air cooler repair services rajkot and spare parts</p>\n\n            <div class=\"overflow-x-auto rounded-3xl border border-gray-200 shadow-xl bg-white\">\n                <table class=\"w-full text-left\">\n                    <thead class=\"bg-gray-900 text-white uppercase text-xs font-black\">\n                        <tr>\n                            <th class=\"p-6\">Component / Service</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-6\">Technical Role</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-6\">Rate (INR)</th>\n                            <th class=\"p-6\">Link</th>\n                        </tr>\n                    </thead>\n                    <tbody class=\"divide-y text-sm\">\n                        <tr>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 font-bold text-blue-900 uppercase text-[10px]\">General Service Visit</td>\n                            <td class=\"p-6 text-[10p