t-xs mb-3 tracking-widest\">Tower Coolers</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-600 uppercase\">Specializing in <span class=\"highlight-gold\">noiseless blower adjustment</span> and remote control PCB repair for urban bungalows.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border-t-4 border-blue-900 shadow-md\">\n                    <h3 class=\"font-black text-blue-900 uppercase text-xs mb-3 tracking-widest\">Industrial Coolers</h3>\n                    <p class=\"text-[10px] text-gray-600 uppercase\">Dedicated team for <span class=\"highlight-orange\">GIDC factory cooling system</span> maintenance in Metoda and Shapar.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n\n        <!-- INDUSTRIAL AREAS SECTION (RAJKOT) -->\n        <section id=\"industrial-gidc\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-black text-blue-900 uppercase mb-8 text-center\">Industrial air cooler repair services rajkot</h2>\n            \n            <p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed text-sm lg:text-base text-center max-w-4xl mx-auto mb-10\">\n                Rajkot&#8217;s industrial sectors are the backbone of Saurashtra. Our specialized industrial team provides <span class=\"highlight-orange\">air cooler repair services rajkot</span> for engineering units, forging plants, and massive warehouses. We offer preventive maintenance contracts to ensure zero downtime during peak summer.\n            </p>\n\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-6 gap-4 text-[10px] font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-gray-500 text-center\">\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Aji GIDC Estate</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Metoda GIDC</span>\n                <span class=\"bg-white p-3 rounded shadow hover:border-orange-500 border transition\">Shapar Ve